1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,980
Oh, yeah.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,500
I'm Philip Davidson.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,280
Detective Jake Peralta asked me to drop by.

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,980
Hmm, the dentist who murdered someone.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,300
Spoiler alert: they think you did it.

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,560
Can you show him to Interrogation Room C, please?

7
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:18,720
Have fun in there.

8
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,480
Thank you.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,600
What are you smiling about?

10
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,880
How uncomfortable this guy is.

11
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,600
Jacked up the thermostat, got the table all sticky,

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,500
made one of the chair legs too short,

13
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,760
and worst of all, I had Gina greet him.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:34,640
What did you have her do?

15
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,500
Be herself.

16
00:00:34,847 --> 00:00:36,400
Poor son of bitch.

17
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:36,920
Yeah.

18
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,140
Why are you wearing a tuxedo?

19
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,700
Kevin and I are attending the opera.

20
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:40,700
Ooh, the opera.

21
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,120
Is it the one Bugs Bunny sings?

22
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:43,820
Yes.

23
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,000
Okay.

24
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,180
So, who's this?

25
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,920
This is Philip Davidson.

26
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:47,710
What do we have on him?

27
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:50,310
Clear motive, clear means, and a nonexistent alibi,

28
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:53,560
but the DA won't bring a charge because he says it's all circumstantial.

29
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,660
If We want to bring this guy down,

30
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,480
we have to get him to confess right here, right now.

31
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:58,010
Mm.

32
00:00:58,010 --> 00:01:01,600
An interrogation with a ticking clock and everything on the line?

33
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:05,000
I better call Kevin and tell him I won't be attending the opera.

34
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,860
There's someone else I'd rather hear sing.

35
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:07,900
Oh, damn!

36
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,380
Hello, Kevin.

37
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:12,380
I won't be joining the opera The tickets are on the line now.

38
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,980
H O L.

39
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,440
right.

40
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:22,980
He did it.

41
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,310
But we have no murder weapon, no witnesses,

42
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:28,180
and you really didn't find any usable forensic evidence?

43
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,190
The body was discovered rotting in the Pine Barrens.
